    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>FastPack</i>\u00a0<i>- Quick Delivery Training Program</i> is a fast paced game where you deliver packages to the correct adress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697540/extras/2109030245f6fdbe8fe7775f9cdcf7d0.poster.avif?t=1751833217\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697540/extras/2109030245f6fdbe8fe7775f9cdcf7d0.webm?t=1751833217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast paced package delivery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive around in a small open world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to strange NPC's</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise your profile</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn a Diploma you can print out and put next to your CV</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade mode:</strong> Deliver packages as fast as possible in a race against the clock. Gain more time by delivering more packages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Contract Mode:</strong> Walk around without time constraint. Complete contracts to gain Money. Contracts are small missions, for example &quot;Deliver 20 packages to Roundington&quot;. </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>FastPack</i>\u00a0<i>- Quick Delivery Training Program</i> is a fast paced game where you deliver packages to the correct adress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697540/extras/2109030245f6fdbe8fe7775f9cdcf7d0.poster.avif?t=1751833217\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697540/extras/2109030245f6fdbe8fe7775f9cdcf7d0.webm?t=1751833217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast paced package delivery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive around in a small open world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to strange NPC's</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise your profile</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn a Diploma you can print out and put next to your CV</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade mode:</strong> Deliver packages as fast as possible in a race against the clock. Gain more time by delivering more packages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Contract Mode:</strong> Walk around without time constraint. Complete contracts to gain Money. Contracts are small missions, for example &quot;Deliver 20 packages to Roundington&quot;. </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "FastPack is the worlds number one leading logistics company. We offer the quickest delivery on the planet! This training program is made for you to get up to speed with our delivery methods. Do you got what it takes to work for us?",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
